lqp\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/j5vvlqp\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/ghw20supporterhiddengaroup\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/n18segp\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0v25ewp\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#404040\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">English is not my native language, so i apologize for errors in grammar or spelling.</span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/392-cadmiumcadamium","name":"Cadmiumcadamium","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar392_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"936"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-25T11:38:38-07:00","id":527913,"title":"","content":"Great job! I'm loving them. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2964-firanai","name":"Firanai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2964_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"672"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-25T11:43:39-07:00","id":527918,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mr Gone</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/525666-m20-character-sheets?p=526189#post526189\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I'll add this to my list and see what I can do when I get some time. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Speaking for myself, I'm more interested in a set of your add-on sheets than in Tradition/Convention sheets - but I'll take whatever you give me!<br /> <br /> Nice job with these. I'll look forward to the drop-down add-ons so I can stop typing so many phrasal verbs....<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&quot;</span>Explanations exist; they have existed for all time; there is always a well-known solution to every human problem \u2014 neat, plausible, and wrong.<span style=\"font-size:14px\">&quot;<br /> - H.L. Mencken</span></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/467-bob-the-skull","name":"Bob the Skull","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar467_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"71"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-26T21:40:10-07:00","id":529590,"title":"","content":"On the M20_4-Page_Official_Interactive.pdf, the M20_4-Page_Technocracy_Interactive.pdf, and the M20_4-Page_Technocracy_v2_Interactive.pdf Allies on page 3 only has one l &quot;Alies&quot;. In the same section, with 30+ backgrounds now part of Mage 20, You might just want to leave more (or all) of the expanded backgrounds with a place to fill-in-the-blank.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:arial\">Jason, the Storyteller<br /> -<br /> &quot;Old dreams become new again in the spring. This is where the nightmares are.&quot;</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1357-storyteller31","name":"Storyteller31","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1357_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"43"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-26T21:56:43-07:00","id":529593,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Storyteller31</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/525666-m20-character-sheets?p=529590#post529590\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You might just want to leave more (or all) of the expanded backgrounds with a place to fill-in-the-blank.</div> </div> </div> </div>I second this idea; as it stands, for the character I've come up with, only one background there (Resources) is one ze actually has. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Also, regardless of how many non-fill-in-the-blank ones there are, it seems like one of the ought to be Avatar, considering how many folks consider that a must-take background. (Yeah, there's space for Avatar description on the other page, but if other backgrounds are being described here...)<br /> <br /> Additionally, does anyone else think it might be good to have callouts for Paradigm, Practice, and Instruments under Focus? There's certainly enough space for it, and I was surprised not to see that split out on the official sheet myself, considering how much is made of those in the book.<br /> <br /> Apart from those, lovely work as always! It's hard for me to imagine playing a WoD game without using a Mr. Gone sheet. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":6157,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6157-indi-latrani","user":"Indi Latrani","date":".  Elaboration 05-27-2015, 01:01 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6157-indi-latrani","name":"Indi Latrani","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6157_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-27T04:38:35-07:00","id":529771,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Bob the Skull</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/525666-m20-character-sheets?p=527918#post527918\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Speaking for myself, I'm more interested in a set of your add-on sheets than in Tradition/Convention sheets - but I'll take whatever you give me!<br /> <br /> Nice job with these. I'll look forward to the drop-down add-ons so I can stop typing so many phrasal verbs....</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks! Yea, I'm sure we'll be adding drop-downs eventually. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> So you prefer the add-on sheets huh? I'm never sure how many people actually use those. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Which ones do you prefer?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Storyteller31</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/525666-m20-character-sheets?p=529590#post529590\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">On the M20_4-Page_Official_Interactive.pdf, the M20_4-Page_Technocracy_Interactive.pdf, and the M20_4-Page_Technocracy_v2_Interactive.pdf Allies on page 3 only has one l &quot;Alies&quot;. In the same section, with 30+ backgrounds now part of Mage 20, You might just want to leave more (or all) of the expanded backgrounds with a place to fill-in-the-blank.</div> </div> </div> </div>Sorry about the typo, I hate when I do that.<br /> <br /> I'm not sure how many more spots for backgrounds I could add there. So, you think I could make the whole section just have type in titles?<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Indi Latrani</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/525666-m20-character-sheets?p=529593#post529593\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I second this idea; as it stands, for the character I've come up with, only one background there (Resources) is one ze actually has. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Also, regardless of how many non-fill-in-the-blank ones there are, it seems like one of the ought to be Avatar, considering how many folks consider that a must-take background. (Yeah, there's space for Avatar description on the other page, but if other backgrounds are being described here...)</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, if I do hard coded backgrounds, then I'll see if I can add it.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Indi Latrani</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/525666-m20-character-sheets?p=529593#post529593\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Additionally, does anyone else think it might be good to have callouts for Paradigm, Practice, and Instruments under Focus? There's certainly enough space for it, and I was surprised not to see that split out on the official sheet myself, considering how much is made of those in the book.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, I made the official sheet, and OP asked me to do the section that way. That bigger section was originally for Rotes, with Focus having the smaller section but they asked me to swap it.<br /> <br /> So, you think I need to add in some spots for Paradigm, Practice, and Instruments? How many lines should those have? And would you have more than one Focus?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Indi Latrani</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/525666-m20-character-sheets?p=529593#post529593\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Apart from those, lovely work as always! It's hard for me to imagine playing a WoD game without using a Mr. Gone sheet. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>Thank you! I'm glad to help everyone out!<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-27T09:17:56-07:00","id":530035,"title":"","content":"First of all, I have to say that you are the fucking master. I don't know if you can say something similar in English, but in Spanish that means that you are the best <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Thank you for your sheets.<br /> <br /> Second, I've seen the Spanish sheet and the name you use for Abilities is different from the one the current WoD publisher in Spanish is using (for both Spain and Latinamerica). This are said abilities and the terms the current publisher is using:<br /> <br /> <br /> Melee: Pelea con Armas (I don't agree with the translation, but it is the official one)<br /> Crafts: Artesan\u00eda<br /> Computers: Inform\u00e1tica<br /> <br /> Just in case you want to change them (I'm not demanding it), or tell Rodolfo.<br /> <br /> And, again, just in case you would like to translate the Technocracy sheet (I don't know if that Rodolfo made the sheet or just told you the translation), I can provide the terms:<br /> <br /> Technocracy: Tecnocracia<br /> Eidolon: Eidolon<br /> Convention: Convenci\u00f3n<br /> Amalgam: Amalgama<br /> Dimensional Science: Ciencia Dimensional<br /> Enlightenment: Iluminaci\u00f3n<br /> Primal Energy: Energ\u00eda Primaria<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3673-mu_","name":"Mu_","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3673_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"99"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-27T09:19:02-07:00","id":530037,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> It's hard for me to imagine playing a WoD game without using a Mr. Gone sheet. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> </div> </div> </div>This, for years. Your kung fu is the best, Mr. Gone. I'm sure you hear it all the time, but I've never told you myself.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/173-morimaruvik","name":"Morimaruvik","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar173_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-27T10:26:19-07:00","id":530106,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mr Gone</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/525666-m20-character-sheets?p=529771#post529771\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm not sure how many more spots for backgrounds I could add there. So, you think I could make the whole section just have type in titles?</div> </div> </div> </div>(Since I like this idea too) I think that'd be the most flexible way personally. I don't think it needs more spots for backgrounds total, just more blank ones. We could probably have a long discussion about which ones should be hard-coded (My own thoughts would probably be just Avatar and Resources) but having them all type-in would definitely cover all the bases, even if it'd be more typing.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mr Gone</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/525666-m20-character-sheets?p=529771#post529771\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So, you think I need to add in some spots for Paradigm, Practice, and Instruments? How many lines should those have? And would you have more than one Focus?</div> </div> </div> </div>Characters only have one Focus (Basically it's the new word for Style) so one Focus block of that size seems correct to me. Everyone has one focus that's made up of the three of those. Basically Paradigm and Practice would both be one or a few small phrases, while Instruments could be a big list of things. I think what would look best would be start-of-line headings as in Description, with 'Paradigm', two or three lines for it, 'Practice', two or three lines for it, and then the rest being for Instruments.<br /> <br /> (I also personally think it'd be cool if the last field on the left on Description was 'Gender' instead of 'Sex' but I probably shouldn't open that can of worms right now. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />)<br /> <br /> Thanks again for being fast and awesome with these! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6157-indi-latrani","name":"Indi Latrani","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6157_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-27T11:00:31-07:00","id":530132,"title":"","content":"I keep looking at pages 2-3-4 and want to do something different with them for M20. A standard WoD character sheet just doesn't seem to cover the way M20 might play. No field experience with this yet, nor have I tried to create any characters for M20 with the sheets, so it's just intuition. Mage characters can now be so differentiated they might just need more custom areas where they can fill in the blank. I'm doing thought experiments to swap the sections around a bit. I'll let you know if I have any revelations as to how I think they might be better organized.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:arial\">Jason, the Storyteller<br /> -<br /> &quot;Old dreams become new again in the spring. This is where the nightmares are.&quot;</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1357-storyteller31","name":"Storyteller31","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1357_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"43"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-27T11:33:15-07:00","id":530163,"title":"","content":"Mr. Gone, you have always been the go-to guy for character sheets all of these years, even back when Windows was still in its infancy for most of the world. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6171-coyotekin","name":"Coyotekin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6171_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-27T16:59:17-07:00","id":530410,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mu_</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/525666-m20-character-sheets?p=530035#post530035\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">First of all, I have to say that you are the fucking master. I don't know if you can say something similar in English, but in Spanish that means that you are the best <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Thank you for your sheets.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well thank you! You very welcome!<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\">