Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">This, for years. Your kung fu is the best, Mr. Gone. I'm sure you hear it all the time, but I've never told you myself.</div> </div> </div> </div>Aww, thank you! I appreciate that!<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Indi Latrani</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/525666-m20-character-sheets?p=530106#post530106\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">(Since I like this idea too) I think that'd be the most flexible way personally. I don't think it needs more spots for backgrounds total, just more blank ones. We could probably have a long discussion about which ones should be hard-coded (My own thoughts would probably be just Avatar and Resources) but having them all type-in would definitely cover all the bases, even if it'd be more typing.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yea, I think the idea of making them all have interactive headers is the way to go. That way people can just make them be whatever.<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Indi Latrani</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/525666-m20-character-sheets?p=530106#post530106\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Characters only have one Focus (Basically it's the new word for Style) so one Focus block of that size seems correct to me. Everyone has one focus that's made up of the three of those. Basically Paradigm and Practice would both be one or a few small phrases, while Instruments could be a big list of things. I think what would look best would be start-of-line headings as in Description, with 'Paradigm', two or three lines for it, 'Practice', two or three lines for it, and then the rest being for Instruments.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ok, thats cool. Thanks for the info! I'll pass it up the powers that be and see what they think. Makes sense to me and I don't have any issues changing it to that.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Indi Latrani</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/525666-m20-character-sheets?p=530106#post530106\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">(I also personally think it'd be cool if the last field on the left on Description was 'Gender' instead of 'Sex' but I probably shouldn't open that can of worms right now. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />)</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't have any issues with that either if thats what everyone wants.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Indi Latrani</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/525666-m20-character-sheets?p=530106#post530106\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Thanks again for being fast and awesome with these! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>You're very welcome. I try my best. Might be a few days before I can make some of these changes though, but I'll try to work on it this weekend if not before then.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Storyteller31</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/525666-m20-character-sheets?p=530132#post530132\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I keep looking at pages 2-3-4 and want to do something different with them for M20. A standard WoD character sheet just doesn't seem to cover the way M20 might play. No field experience with this yet, nor have I tried to create any characters for M20 with the sheets, so it's just intuition. Mage characters can now be so differentiated they might just need more custom areas where they can fill in the blank. I'm doing thought experiments to swap the sections around a bit. I'll let you know if I have any revelations as to how I think they might be better organized.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, if think up something, let me know. Maybe I can do some kind of alternate or unofficial sheet. We'll see how it goes.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Coyotekin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/525666-m20-character-sheets?p=530163#post530163\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Mr. Gone, you have always been the go-to guy for character sheets all of these years, even back when Windows was still in its infancy for most of the world. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>Thank you. I guess I have been doing it for a long time now... I'm just glad everyone likes my work. Just sorry I don't get to do as much of it as I used to. But, at least I get to make most of the official sheets these days.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-27T18:00:46-07:00","id":530457,"title":"","content":"Just so y'all know, I went ahead and updated the Expanded Backgrounds sections of the Official 4 Page sheet(on my site) and the Technocracy sheets. I made all the headers type in fields. Take a look and see what you think. Hope you like em...<br /> <br /> I'll work on the stuff before too long, but I had a little bit of time tonight so I thought I'd get that done. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-01T09:14:54-07:00","id":535667,"title":"","content":"Something that came up in a W20 game we played recently. Bigger boxes for health levels. You can see a &quot;/&quot; or &quot;X&quot; pretty well, but &quot;*&quot; just isn't viewable in those boxes on US letter sized paper.<br /> <br /> PS - Still working on coming up with an alternate layout for M20 pages 2-4.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:arial\">Jason, the Storyteller<br /> -<br /> &quot;Old dreams become new again in the spring. This is where the nightmares are.&quot;</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1357-storyteller31","name":"Storyteller31","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1357_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"43"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-01T11:56:31-07:00","id":535760,"title":"","content":"Hey is there any possibility of you doing sorcerer's crusade sheets too? pretty please? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2964-firanai","name":"Firanai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2964_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"672"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-02T04:31:12-07:00","id":536800,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Storyteller31</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/525666-m20-character-sheets?p=535667#post535667\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Something that came up in a W20 game we played recently. Bigger boxes for health levels. You can see a &quot;/&quot; or &quot;X&quot; pretty well, but &quot;*&quot; just isn't viewable in those boxes on US letter sized paper.</div> </div> </div> </div>Hmmm...haven't heard of any issues before, and I've been using the same health boxes for like 10 years now(maybe longer). You're just writing them in, right?<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Storyteller31</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/525666-m20-character-sheets?p=535667#post535667\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">PS - Still working on coming up with an alternate layout for M20 pages 2-4.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thats ok. Take your time. I haven;t even started on anything for these yet...<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Firanai</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/525666-m20-character-sheets?p=535760#post535760\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hey is there any possibility of you doing sorcerer's crusade sheets too? pretty please? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>I hadn't thought about it, but I guess I can add it to the list. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Isn't much to change aside from the skills, and maybe a few bits on the other pages...right?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-04T10:03:20-07:00","id":539683,"title":"","content":"Found something else misspelled. 4-page sheets under Armor. &quot;Penality&quot; should be &quot;Penalty&quot;. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:arial\">Jason, the Storyteller<br /> -<br /> &quot;Old dreams become new again in the spring. This is where the nightmares are.&quot;</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1357-storyteller31","name":"Storyteller31","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1357_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"43"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-04T11:39:41-07:00","id":539762,"title":"","content":"<b>M20, 4 page, Alternate Layout</b><br /> <br /> I really don't have much after trying to fiddle with it. I just have some suggestions that are really minor and might please only me. Please seek feedback from others before you go creating sheets just to suit my whims.<br /> <br /> P. 1<ul><li>Reorder Nature/Demeanor/Essence to Essence/Nature/Demeanor</li> </ul><br /> p. 2<ul><li>Combat section more like W20. Combat chart with &quot;roll&quot; rather than &quot;conceal&quot;. That brawling chart from the W20 sheet sure came in handy during a recent W20 game. Not sure if it would be as handy during a Mage game or not. IMO, Armor only needs that one line ala W20 sheet.</li> <li>In the Magic (Magick) section move &quot;focus&quot; to the left-hand column. Remove &quot;wonders&quot; and &quot;rotes&quot; headers in favor of just a blank column with lines.</li> </ul><br /> p. 3<ul><li>Change &quot;chantry&quot; header to &quot;locations&quot;.</li> <li>Make possessions three columns ala Demon V20, 4 page. Title columns &quot;Gear (Carried)&quot;, &quot;Equipment (Owned)&quot; and &quot;Misc.&quot;</li> </ul><br /> p. 4<ul><li>&quot;Culture&quot; to replace &quot;Awakening&quot; header. Alternate header for &quot;culture&quot; might be &quot;Mundane&quot; or &quot;Mundane History&quot;</li> <li>&quot;Awakening&quot; header to replace &quot;Goals/Destiny&quot;</li> <li>&quot;Goals/Destiny&quot; to replace &quot;Quiets&quot;</li> <li>&quot;Sex&quot; replaced with &quot;Gender&quot;</li> </ul><br /> I can give my reasonings in a follow-up post if anyone has questions.<br /> <br /> PS - In the vein of pleasing only me, I'd love to see an interactive M20 sheet that has blank ability lines ala W20 4 page blanks skills interactive. I'm planning to change the abilities for my M20 game and that would make it really, really easy. Blank spheres might be cool too for those Data, Dimensional Science, Primal Utility alternate sphere names. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:arial\">Jason, the Storyteller<br /> -<br /> &quot;Old dreams become new again in the spring. This is where the nightmares are.&quot;</span>","edited":{"userid":1357,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1357-storyteller31","user":"Storyteller31","date":".  I changed my mind after working with the sheet to create an actual character. I removed some stuff I requested. Needs bigger fonts! 06-05-2015, 01:38 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1357-storyteller31","name":"Storyteller31","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1357_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"43"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-04T13:08:32-07:00","id":539895,"title":"","content":"Hi MrGone, just wanted to say thank you for continuing to create and release sheets for us <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5439-gullinbursti","name":"Gullinbursti","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5439_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"291"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-05T04:23:37-07:00","id":540935,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Storyteller31</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/525666-m20-character-sheets?p=539683#post539683\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Found something else misspelled. 4-page sheets under Armor. &quot;Penality&quot; should be &quot;Penalty&quot;. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>If you look at almost all my CWoD sheet, it's spelled that way. It's a stretch, but it almost still works:<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://www.merriam-webster.com/dictionary/penality\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.merriam-webster.com/dictionary/penality</a><br /> <br /> LOL<br /> <br /> Trying to decide if I leave it be as an in joke for me or what. We'll see.... :P<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Storyteller31</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/525666-m20-character-sheets?p=539762#post539762\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>M20, 4 page, Alternate Layout</b><br /> <br /> I really don't have much after trying to fiddle with it. I just have some suggestions that are really minor and might please only me. Please seek feedback from others before you go creating sheets just to suit my whims.<br /> <br /> P. 1<ul><li>Reorder Nature/Demeanor/Essence to Essence/Nature/Demeanor</li> </ul><br /> <br /> p. 2<ul><li>Combat section more like W20. Combat chart with &quot;roll&quot; rather than &quot;conceal&quot;. That brawling chart from the W20 sheet sure came in handy during a recent W20 game. Not sure if it would be as handy during a Mage game or not. IMO, Armor only needs that one line ala W20 sheet.</li> <li>In the Magic (Magick) section move &quot;focus&quot; to the left-hand column. Remove &quot;wonders&quot; and &quot;rotes&quot; headers in favor of just a blank column with lines.</li> </ul><br /> <br /> p. 3<ul><li>Change &quot;chantry&quot; header to &quot;locations&quot;.</li> <li>Make possessions three columns ala Demon V20, 4 page. Title columns &quot;Gear (Carried)&quot;, &quot;Equipment (Owned)&quot; and &quot;Misc.&quot;</li> </ul><br /> <br /> p. 4<ul><li>&quot;Culture&quot; to replace &quot;Awakening&quot; header. Alternate header for &quot;culture&quot; might be &quot;Mundane&quot; or &quot;Mundane History&quot;</li> <li>&quot;Awakening&quot; header to replace &quot;Goals/Destiny&quot;</li> <li>&quot;Goals/Destiny&quot; to replace &quot;Quiets&quot;</li> <li>&quot;Sex&quot; replaced with &quot;Gender&quot;</li> </ul><br /> <br /> I can give my reasonings in a follow-up post if anyone has questions.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks for the suggestions. I'll keep those in mind and might make it for you, if I get the time. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Storyteller31</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/525666-m20-character-sheets?p=539762#post539762\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">PS - In the vein of pleasing only me, I'd love to see an interactive M20 sheet that has blank ability lines ala W20 4 page blanks skills interactive. I'm planning to change the abilities for my M20 game and that would make it really, really easy.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yea, I asked about the blank line at the bottom of the abilities list when I did up the M20 sheet, but they didn't seem to need them. You're wanting all the abilities lines to be blank though?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Storyteller31</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/525666-m20-character-sheets?p=539762#post539762\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Blank spheres might be cool too for those Data, Dimensional Science, Primal Utility alternate sphere names. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>I did that for the Technocracy sheet as an alternate version, so maybe I'll do an alternate regular sheet that way as well...<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Gullinbursti</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/525666-m20-character-sheets?p=539895#post539895\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hi MrGone, just wanted to say thank you for continuing to create and release sheets for us <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>Aww, thank you! I appreciate that! I'm just you(and everyone else) still like the work I do. I know I don't get to do it as often these days, but I'm always happy to do what I can. So I'm just glad everyone still enjoys it.<br /> <br /> Thank you!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-05T05:12:58-07:00","id":541008,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mr Gone</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/525666-m20-character-sheets?p=540935#post540935\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yea, I asked about the blank line at the bottom of the abilities list when I did up the M20 sheet, but they didn't seem to need them. You're wanting all the abilities lines to be blank though?</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, I plan to majorly reshuffle Abilities. My example and reasons are in the M20 House Rules thread. The W20 sheet is exactly named &quot;W20 4 page blanks skills interactive&quot;. After making some characters last night to try out the new focus rules, I know my players are going to complain about the interactive fields' small text. The interactive fields just need to be a liiiiiittle bit taller to go to the next size up of text. Old gamers have failing eyesight. *sigh*","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:arial\">Jason, the Storyteller<br /> -<br /> &quot;Old dreams become new again in the spring. This is where the nightmares are.&quot;</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1357-storyteller31","name":"Storyteller31","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1357_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"43"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-05T17:54:40-07:00","id":541895,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Storyteller31</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/525666-m20-character-sheets?p=541008#post541008\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yeah, I plan to majorly reshuffle Abilities. My example and reasons are in the M20 House Rules thread. The W20 sheet is exactly named &quot;W20 4 page blanks skills interactive&quot;.</div> </div> </div> </div>:: looks at site :: What do you know, I did make a W20 sheet with Blank Skills. LOL. Sometimes I can't remember what all I've worked on...<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Storyteller31</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/525666-m20-character-sheets?p=541008#post541008\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">After making some characters last night to try out the new focus rules, I know my players are going to complain about the interactive fields' small text. The interactive fields just need to be a liiiiiittle bit taller to go to the next size up of text. Old gamers have failing eyesight. *sigh*</div> </div> </div> </div>Hmmm....maybe I can remake them. Them seem ok on my end though, maybe being about 10 or 11 pt font. But anyway, we'll see how it goes... <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-28T17:29:12-07:00","id":572025,"title":"","content":"Hey everyone. I might be starting some work on new M20 sheets for Traditions and such soonish. Before I get too into it, I had a few questions I wanted to ask.<br /> <br /> 1. Do you prefer the official border, or since these are sort of unofficial would you prefer the alternate border that Arthur made(see here: <a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/pdf/M20/M20Quickstart_4-PageSheet_v2_Interactive.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/pd...nteractive.pdf</a> )? I'd rather not have too many versions, so I want to stick to one border type.<br /> <br /> 2. For the Spheres, would you rather they be hard coded, or type in lines? I know some traditions have alternate names for spheres, so I wondered peoples thoughts.<br /> <br /> 3. You you rather the tradition/convention symbols be watermarks like the Revised sheets, or in the upper corners like the old 2nd ed sheets?<br /> <br /> <br /> I think thats it for now. If I think of any more questions I'll let you know. And thanks in advance for the help! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":24,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","user":"Mr Gone","date":". 06-29-2015, 11:24 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-28T18:00:51-07:00","id":572042,"title":"","content":"Since the book uses one, I'd say make the purple alternate one just the basic 2-4 sheets.<br /> <br /> Didn't you have some way you were working on a drop-down, or something, that could change the icons/symbols? Maybe have an option for which background you want? Just a thought. But since the book has one way, I'd say keep with the gold for all of the traditions/etc.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">- Arthur &quot;Torakhan&quot; Dreese <span style=\"color:silver\"><b>David &quot;Wall-of-Text&quot; Tealdeer</b> - US2012070036\u200b - Grand Rapids, MI</span><br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img855/1250/jv8k.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><br /> <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/nmeqe3m\" target=\"_blank\">V:tM 20th</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/pavtnjj\" target=\"_blank\">Hunters Hunted II</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/l3hjgjt\" target=\"_blank\">Anarchs Unbound</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/mxyvsy9\" target=\"_blank\">W:tA 20th</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/k5qe4j4\" target=\"_blank\">W20 Changing Breeds</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/m64m9o5\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted 3rd Edition</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/qxkop7m\" target=\"_blank\">M:tA 20th</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/nd6kms2\" target=\"_blank\">W20BotW</a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/780-torakhan","name":"Torakhan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar780_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"576"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-28T19:23:24-07:00","id":572103,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Torakhan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/525666-m20-character-sheets?p=572042#post572042\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Since the book uses one, I'd say make the purple alternate one just the basic 2-4 sheets.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yea, I could do an alternate version of the main sheet. I'd hate not to use the border you made...I love it.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Torakhan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/525666-m20-character-sheets?p=572042#post572042\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Didn't you have some way you were working on a drop-down, or something, that could change the icons/symbols? Maybe have an option for which background you want? Just a thought.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yea, I briefly played with the idea of layers(I've seen a handful of sheets that use em). It's a little hard to set up, but might be worth looking into again.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Torakhan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/525666-m20-character-sheets?p=572042#post572042\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">But since the book has one way, I'd say keep with the gold for all of the traditions/etc.</div> </div> </div> </div>Kind of what I was thinking, but I wanted to see what everyone thought before I started... Matching the official does make sense.<br /> <br /> Thanks for the feedback!<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-29T05:00:40-07:00","id":572525,"title":"","content":"The link you gave us gives me a 404, so I have no basis or comparison :P","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:arial\">What doesn't kill you, makes you...<i> stranger</i>.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1182-asmodai","name":"Asmodai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1182_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2989"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-29T08:25:05-07:00","id":572684,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Asmodai</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/525666-m20-character-sheets?p=572525#post572525\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The link you gave us gives me a 404, so I have no basis or comparison :P</div> </div> </div> </div>It put a &quot;?&quot; at the end of the link for some reason. I fixed it in the post above, try again..","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-29T15:29:45-07:00","id":573275,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mr Gone</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/525666-m20-character-sheets?p=572025#post572025\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">1. Do you prefer the official border, or since these are sort of unofficial would you prefer the alternate border that Arthur made(see here: <a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/pdf/M20/M20Quickstart_4-PageSheet_v2_Interactive.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/pd...nteractive.pdf</a> )? I'd rather not have too many versions, so I want to stick to one border type.</div> </div> </div> </div>I really like the border in the link there, it definitely recalls the book border but is less overwhelming, it makes the sheet contents easier to read I think.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mr Gone</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/525666-m20-character-sheets?p=572025#post572025\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">2. For the Spheres, would you rather they be hard coded, or type in lines? I know some traditions have alternate names for spheres, so I wondered peoples thoughts.</div> </div> </div> </div>In practice I think there are only three alternate sphere names now (Data for Correspondence, Dimensional Science for Spirit, and Primal Utility for Prime), so those could be done via drop-down perhaps?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mr Gone</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/525666-m20-character-sheets?p=572025#post572025\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">3. You you rather the tradition/convention symbols be watermarks like the Revised sheets, or in the upper corners like the old 2nd ed sheets?</div> </div> </div> </div>Personally I like the idea of watermarks, but either way is fine.<br /> <br /> Thanks for all your work on these, definitely looking forward to the new sheets! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6157-indi-latrani","name":"Indi Latrani","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6157_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-29T16:54:25-07:00","id":573315,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Indi Latrani</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/525666-m20-character-sheets?p=573275#post573275\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I really like the border in the link there, it definitely recalls the book border but is less overwhelming, it makes the sheet contents easier to read I think.</div> </div> </div> </div>I liked it too, because of the Purple. I'd hoped they used something like that for the official one, but alas...<br /> <br /> If I don't use it for the Tradition sheets, I'll use it for an alternate version of the main sheet, just so I can use it.<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Indi Latrani</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/525666-m20-character-sheets?p=573275#post573275\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In practice I think there are only three alternate sphere names now (Data for Correspondence, Dimensional Science for Spirit, and Primal Utility for Prime), so those could be done via drop-down perhaps?</div> </div> </div> </div>I'd think a drop down might break the aesthetic of the sheet, so I'd want to hard coded or type in lines. I already have the name changed for the Technocracy sheet, so no issue there. I just thought some of the traditions had a few different terms..<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Indi Latrani</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/525666-m20-character-sheets?p=573275#post573275\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Personally I like the idea of watermarks, but either way is fine.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ok, cool. Thanks for the vote! Just trying to get a general consensus before I start. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Indi Latrani</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/525666-m20-character-sheets?p=573275#post573275\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Thanks for all your work on these, definitely looking forward to the new sheets! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>You're very welcome! Might be a little bit before they're ready. I'm considering waiting to see what OP wants me to do with the official sheets regarding drop downs and such, so I may wait for the Official sheets to get finalized before I start on these. But, I figured I start a little pre-work to get a jump on it. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key