:670879,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dwight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/525666-m20-character-sheets?p=670349#post670349\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Not your fault OP has been dragging their feet.</div> </div> </div> </div>Not sure they're dragging their feet, guess they're just busy with stuff. I think they were waiting on feedback to update the book before getting me the info for the drop downs.<br /> <br /> Anyway, I didn't want to start cranking out sheets until that was finalized...<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>grapefruit</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/525666-m20-character-sheets?p=670716#post670716\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Not sure if it's been mentioned but, under Armor, you've put 'penality'.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's almost a trademark at this point, as a lot of my sheets have it misspelled that way, but.....<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://dictionary.reference.com/browse/penality\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://dictionary.reference.com/browse/penality\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://dictionary.reference.com/browse/penality\" target=\"_blank\"> http://dictionary.reference.com/browse/penality </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> :P<br /> <br /> I might see about fixing it when I do the next update.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-27T06:34:11-08:00","id":838017,"title":"","content":"The walls of reality crumble....and I rise again!<br /> <br /> :P<br /> <br /> Ok, it's been awhile.....but I haven't forgotten Mage. I'm hoping to devote some attention to M20 soon and start working on some branded sheets and some add-on sheets.<br /> <br /> I really don't want to do a bunch of alternative versions, so before I start, are there any special requests or updates I should do the main M20 sheet before making the Tradition and Convention sheets? Also, do you all like the Official M20 Border (see here: <a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/pdf/M20/M20_1-Page_Official_Interactive.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/pd...nteractive.pdf</a>) or the one that Arthur Dreese made (see here: <a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/pdf/M20/M20QuickstartSheet_v2_Interactive.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/pd...nteractive.pdf</a>). I lean towards the 2nd one, but I want to give the people what they want....so let me know.<br /> <br /> Anyway, sorry it's been so long before I could devote some attention to this. I just need more hours in the day.<br /> <br /> I'm not gonna put on a deadline on these, but I'll let you know when I have em ready. Thanks for being patient with me...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-27T07:00:53-08:00","id":838031,"title":"","content":"I think the key difference should be which one looks better in greyscale <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> Could you possibly add one or two blank abilities under each category? I've found that people are often left with skills they wish they had or are unware you could add extra skills.<br /> Also I'd love to see a Sorceror's Crusade sheet updated with the M20 info.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:arial\">What doesn't kill you, makes you...<i> stranger</i>.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1182-asmodai","name":"Asmodai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1182_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2989"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-27T08:35:08-08:00","id":838064,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Asmodai</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/525666-m20-character-sheets?p=838031#post838031\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think the key difference should be which one looks better in greyscale <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>I'd say they probably look the same in greyscale. Probably. The color difference are subtle...but basically the official one is all yellow, while the 2nd version has a hint of purple for the outside flair...<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Asmodai</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/525666-m20-character-sheets?p=838031#post838031\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Could you possibly add one or two blank abilities under each category? I've found that people are often left with skills they wish they had or are unware you could add extra skills.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thats what I have an &quot;Other Traits&quot; section for...but, if I can shore up some room, I'll see if I can add an extra line or two in the abilities section.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Asmodai</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/525666-m20-character-sheets?p=838031#post838031\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Also I'd love to see a Sorceror's Crusade sheet updated with the M20 info.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'll add it to my list. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-27T12:48:43-08:00","id":838177,"title":"","content":"So, I have a question and then a possible big favor...<br /> <br /> The question: Since these will be essentially &quot;unofficial&quot; versions, I wanted to ask about the health section. For the official one, they have these grey bars behind every other health level. Do you guys like the look of that? Or should I ditch em?<br /> <br /> The favor: Would some kind soul be willing to type up some lists of things like backgrounds, Nature and Demeanor's, merits and flaws and such? Right now the sheets are all type-ins, and I wouldn't mind making some drop down menus. Assuming you guys would want drop down menus...<br /> <br /> <br /> Thanks in advance!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-27T13:29:57-08:00","id":838195,"title":"","content":"Also, there was a thread that came up a bit back ago and the subject of Resonance was brought up. This was posted:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dataweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/798382-so-would-anyone-else-agree-with-me-that-mage-20-is-an-awful-corebook?p=804100#post804100\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Resonance/Synergy is an <i>optional</i> set of traits in M20, which will be more fully detailed for those who want to use it once <b>Book of Secrets</b> comes out. So no, it isn't needed for the character sheet \u2014 though you might want to prep alternate versions that <i>do</i> include it for when the aforementioned supplement comes out. Resonance and Synergy are different takes on the same concept, and you're exceedingly unlikely to need both on one sheet; they both involve a one-to-five dot rating for a handful of traits, and they differ as to what those traits are: the four flavor of Resonance are Devotional, Elemental, Stabilizing, and Temperamental; the three favors of Synergy are Dynamic, Entropic, and Static. See M20 pp.560\u2013561.</div> </div> </div> </div>Whats the word on that? Do I need to add some section that could be used for either Resonance/Synergy? Or would that work under the other traits section?<br /> <br /> Figured since I was working on the branded sheets I better figure what out the deal is with this...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-27T15:07:38-08:00","id":838240,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mr Gone</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/525666-m20-character-sheets?p=838177#post838177\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So, I have a question and then a possible big favor...<br /> <br /> The question: Since these will be essentially &quot;unofficial&quot; versions, I wanted to ask about the health section. For the official one, they have these grey bars behind every other health level. Do you guys like the look of that? Or should I ditch em?<br /> <br /> The favor: Would some kind soul be willing to type up some lists of things like backgrounds, Nature and Demeanor's, merits and flaws and such? Right now the sheets are all type-ins, and I wouldn't mind making some drop down menus. Assuming you guys would want drop down menus...<br /> <br /> <br /> Thanks in advance!</div> </div> </div> </div>Honestly I don't mind the different colors, but with all the writing and erasing that happens in that area, it will detoriate quickly.<br /> <br /> Nature &amp; Demeanor (but let people write in their own, not just pulldown!)<br /> ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------<br /> Activist<br /> Benefactor<br /> Contrary<br /> Crusader<br /> Hacker<br /> Idealist<br /> Innovator<br /> Kid<br /> Machine<br /> Mad Scientist<br /> Martyr<br /> Monster<br /> Prophet<br /> Rogue<br /> Sensualist<br /> Survivor<br /> Traditionalist<br /> Trickster<br /> Visionary<br /> <br /> <br /> Backgrounds (allow for writeins!)<br /> -------------------<br /> Allies<br /> Alternate Identity<br /> Arcane<br /> *Cloaking<br /> Avatar<br /> *Genius<br /> Backup<br /> Blessing<br /> Certification<br /> Chantry<br /> *Construct<br /> Contacts<br /> Cult<br /> Demesne<br /> Destiny<br /> Dream<br /> *Hypercram<br /> Enhancement<br /> Fame<br /> Familiar<br /> *Companion<br /> Influence<br /> Legend<br /> Library<br /> Mentor<br /> Node<br /> Past Lives<br /> Patron<br /> Rank<br /> Requisitions<br /> Resources<br /> Retainers<br /> Sanctum<br /> *Laboratory<br /> Secret Weapons<br /> Spies<br /> Status<br /> Totem<br /> Wonder<br /> *Fetish<br /> *Talisman<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:arial\">What doesn't kill you, makes you...<i> stranger</i>.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1182-asmodai","name":"Asmodai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1182_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{