7255,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nail Eater</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/525666-m20-character-sheets?p=1266804#post1266804\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I don't know what's happening but my Adobe Reader has a problem with your 4 page sheet: it doesn't see any letter from 2nd to 4th page. I can write the backgrounds in but it still doesn't see it. Other reader sees them but I can't edit the sheet with it. Also I can't change font size. I use Android based tablet (the most advanced technology I have :P). So maybe you could put a non interactive sheets for people like me? Pretty please <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>That's really strange. Is it just with the M20 sheet, or others?<br /> <br /> I did some testing in Acrobat Reader on my iphone, and yea, looks like none of the hard coded text is appearing. Looks to be an issue with the embedded font. I'll see what I can do about getting that fixed. All the interactive fields seemed to work normally though.<br /> <br /> Anyway, I'll try to get that fixed soon, sorry about the issue..","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-14T12:20:41-08:00","id":1267382,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mr Gone</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/525666-m20-character-sheets?p=1267255#post1267255\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> That's really strange. Is it just with the M20 sheet, or others?<br /> <br /> I did some testing in Acrobat Reader on my iphone, and yea, looks like none of the hard coded text is appearing. Looks to be an issue with the embedded font. I'll see what I can do about getting that fixed. All the interactive fields seemed to work normally though.<br /> <br /> Anyway, I'll try to get that fixed soon, sorry about the issue..</div> </div> </div> </div>Just checked W20 4 page interactive sheet and I can't open it and V20 4 page Neonate interactive sheet and everything looks normal. Checked them on Lenovo Tab 2 and Samsung Galaxy A5 using Adobe Reader.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Warrior of the Rainbow<br /> Saint among the sinners<br /> Pure among the dirt<br /> Loser among winners","edited":{"userid":13141,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13141-nail-eater","user":"Nail Eater","date":". 11-15-2018, 08:24 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13141-nail-eater","name":"Nail Eater","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"577"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-16T16:20:43-08:00","id":1268083,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nail Eater</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/525666-m20-character-sheets?p=1267382#post1267382\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Just checked W20 4 page interactive sheet and I can't open it and V20 4 page Neonate interactive sheet and everything looks normal. Checked them on Lenovo Tab 2 and Samsung Galaxy A5 using Adobe Reader.</div> </div> </div> </div>Hmmm....I'll look into the W20 sheet then... Thanks for checking.<br /> <br /> I did some digging on the M20 sheets, and it looks like some weird font embedding issue. I'll try to get it sorted and then I'll have to partly rebuild all the M20 sheets. It'll take a bit of work, but I'll get it sorted. I'll let you know when I have them fixed...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-16T17:13:41-08:00","id":1268105,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13141-nail-eater\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"13141\" data-vbnamecard=\"13141\">Nail Eater</a> Do me a favor, check the regular M20 4 page sheet in your Acrobat Reader app:<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/hqor5221ci2696z/M20_4-Page_Interactive.pdf?dl=1\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.dropbox.com/s/hqor5221ci...ctive.pdf?dl=1</a><br /> <br /> It took me a bit of doing, but I had to switch the font I was using to a different one(that looks the same) and it seems to work in my Acrobat Reader app on my iphone. So hopefully it works for you.<br /> <br /> If so, then I'll see what I can do about rebuilding all my M20 sheets. It'll take a while, but we'll see how it goes.<br /> <br /> <br /> I don't know what I'm going to do about the W20 sheets. The fonts all seem embedded properly, so I'm not sure why the Acrobat app won't display it. I checked it in a different PDF reader app I have and it seemed ok. So I'm not sure what's going on with that...<br /> <br /> Anyway, let me know about the M20 one I linked to above....","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _______________